 row A : coefficient rate sigma_A = k + log lam1 = 4.079441541679835928251696364374529704227   form rate log|L_n|/n = 2.000000000000000000000000000000000000000
 row C : coefficient rate sigma_C = 4.197224577336219382790490473845051409295   form rate = 2.000000000000000000000000000000000000000
 joint  sigma = 4.197224577336219382790490473845051409295   tau = delta/sigma = -0.4765053580405044079735121427875232009574
